 "intro_html": "Unlike the cucumbers, which get a small dressing-style marinade, the radishes <b>soak in a large amount of liquid</b>: cut, salt briefly, then leave it fully submerged in a sweet-vinegar brine (amazu) in the fridge. Pick your vinegar below and the amounts update.",
